# PR: Support 'longtext' custom field data type and unknown type fallback (#672)

## Summary of Changes
- **Longtext Enum Support:** Added `longtext` to `DataTypeEnum` to support Paperless-ngx v3.0+ multi-line long text custom fields.
- **Resilience Against Future Types:** Added `@JsonKey(unknownEnumValue: DataTypeEnum.string)` on `CustomField.dataType` so introducing any new custom field types upstream in Paperless-ngx will no longer crash the entire custom fields fetch.
- **UI & Form Editor Mapping:** Render `longtext` with `StringFieldValue` in document overview and `StringFormField` in edit mode.
- **Icons & Metadata:** Mapped `Icons.notes` as the icon for `longtext` and added display names in the label creation/edit dialogs.
- **Automated Tests:** Added unit tests verifying `longtext` parsing and unknown type fallback behavior.

